          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "The position $y(t),$ measured in inches, of a particle oscillating with forced harmonic motion with light damping is governed by the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2033}+2{y}^{\u2032}+5y=34\\operatorname{cos}\u20612t,\n$$\n\nwhere $t>0$ is the time, in seconds. Given that the particle is initially at the origin with zero velocity, find the position of the particle after $\\pi $ seconds.",
